/* DATA DESCRIPTION:
Citation:	Petersen, Sven (2019): Raw multibeam EM122 data and data products: METEOR cruise M127 (TAG Hydrothermal Field, Atlantic) [dataset]. GEOMAR - Helmholtz Centre for Ocean Research Kiel, PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.899408
Abstract:	Edited and raw ship-based multibeam data covering the TAG hydrothermal Field at 26°N, Mid-Atlantic Ridge. Raw multibeam data was acquired with a Kongsberg EM122 system at 12 kHz and is provided as Kongsberg vendor format /*.all/ files. The datasets also includes a Geotif of the edited bathymetric grid (in WGS84) with 30m resolution as well as a Geotif of the backscatter information (WGS84; 35m resolution). Edited multibeam data includes approved xyz-data (soundings; WGS84) and a gridded dataset (WGS84; resolution 30m).
Keyword(s):	Bathymetry
Related to:	Murton, Bramley J; Lehrmann, Berit; Dutrieux, Adeline M; Martins, Sofia; de la Iglesia, Alba Gil; Stobbs, Iain; Barriga, Fernando J A S; Bialas, Jörg; Dannowski, Anke; Vardy, Mark E; North, Laurence J; Yeo, Isobel; Lusty, Paul A J; Petersen, Sven (2019): Geological fate of seafloor massive sulphides at the TAG hydrothermal field (Mid-Atlantic Ridge). Ore Geology Reviews, 107, 903-925, https://doi.org/10.1016/j.oregeorev.2019.03.005
	Petersen, Sven; Augustin, Nico (2016): Raw multibeam EM122 data: transits of METEOR cruise M127 [dataset]. PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.864817
	Petersen, Sven; Hannington, Mark D; Krätschell, Anna (2017): Technology developments in the exploration and evaluation of deep-sea mineral resources. Annales des Mines - Responsabilite et Environnement, 85(1), 14-18
	Petersen, Sven; Shipboard Scientific Party (2016): RV METEOR Fahrtbericht / Cruise Report M127 Metal fluxes and Resource Potential at the Slow-spreading TAG Midocean Ridge Segment (26°N, MAR) - Blue Mining@Sea, Bridgetown (Barbados) - Ponta Delgada (Portugal), 25.05.-28.06.2016 (Extended Version). GEOMAR Report (N. Ser.), 32, 163 pp, https://doi.org/10.3289/GEOMAR_REP_NS_32_2016
	Szitkar, Florent; Dyment, Jérôme; Petersen, Sven; Bialas, Jörg; Klischies, Meike; Graber, Sebastian; Klaeschen, Dirk; Yeo, Isobel; Murton, Bramley J (2019): Detachment tectonics at Mid-Atlantic Ridge 26°N. Scientific Reports, 9(1), https://doi.org/10.1038/s41598-019-47974-z
Project(s):	Breakthrough Solutions for Mineral Extraction and Processing in Extreme Environment – Blue Mining (BlueMining) (URI: https://slotenmaker-nodig.nl/)
